y. The second line contains n numbers in the non-decreasing order . The i -th of them, a i , represents the rank of the i -th soldier in the defense building ( 1ΓÇëΓëñΓÇë i ΓÇëΓëñΓÇë n , 1ΓÇëΓëñΓÇë a i ΓÇëΓëñΓÇë k ).\n\n## Output\n\nPrint a single integer ΓÇö the number of golden coins needed to raise all the soldiers to the maximal rank.\n\n## Examples\n\nExample 1:\n```\n4 4\n1 2 2 3\n```\n```\n4\n```\n\n## Note\n\nIn the first example the ranks will be raised in the following manner:\n\n 1 2 2 3 ΓÇëΓåÆΓÇë 2 2 3 4 ΓÇëΓåÆΓÇë 2 3 4 4 ΓÇëΓåÆΓÇë 3 4 4 4 ΓÇëΓåÆΓÇë 4 4 4 4 \n\nThus totals to 4 training sessions that require 4 golden coins.","type":"text"}],"contestId":63,"index":"B","memoryLimit":"256 megabytes","name":"Settlers' Training","problemKey":"63-B","rating":null,"tags":[],"timeLimit":"2 seconds","url":"https://codeforces.com/contest/63/problem/B"},{"approaches":[{"label":"Approach 1","number":1,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 2","number":2,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 3","number":3,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 4","number":4,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 5","number":5,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 6","number":6,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 7","number":7,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 8","number":8,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 9","number":9,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 10","number":10,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 11","number":11,"solutions":[{"code":"","fileName":"main.cpp","language":"cpp"}]},{"label":"Approach 12","n